## Model card

Name: Grok 4.20 (Reasoning). Alias family includes grok-4.20, grok-4.20-reasoning, and grok-4.20-reasoning-gv2. Not a free-tier model. Sibling: grok-4.20-0309-non-reasoning.
Short description: xAI’s March 2026 reasoning chat model (docs.x.ai; models.dev lab xAI; Artificial Analysis and OpenRouter brand the lab SpaceXAI) aimed at document-heavy analysis and tool use. Artificial Analysis treats “Grok 4.20 0309 v2 (Reasoning)” as the current public card and marks it deprecated in favor of Grok 4.3; OpenCode Zen does not list it (catalog has Grok 4.5–4.7 only).
Provider / access: xAI API model name grok-4.20-0309-reasoning, alias grok-4.20 (docs.x.ai chat model; function calling, structured outputs, Batch API). OpenRouter Chat Completions x-ai/grok-4.20. No OpenCode Zen ID (opencode/<id> not listed, 2026-09-28).
Release / knowledge: Checkpoint/release 2026-03-09 (models.dev; ID 0309). Artificial Analysis dates the v2 card 2026-04-07 and an earlier 0309 card 2026-03-10. Knowledge cutoff not published.
IDs: xai/grok-4.20-0309-reasoning; OpenRouter x-ai/grok-4.20. No Free ID on OpenCode Zen.
Context window: 1,000,000 total, output limit 30,000 (docs.x.ai and models.dev first-party xAI row). Artificial Analysis and some gateways list 2,000,000; that figure is not on the vendor card, so scoring uses 1,000,000.
Modalities: Text and image in (jpg/jpeg/png, max 20MiB); text out. Reasoning yes on the reasoning ID. Tool calls and structured outputs yes. No verified audio, video, or PDF in, and no non-text out. logprobs silently ignored on grok-4.20 and newer (docs.x.ai).
Pricing (as of 2026-09-29): Paid. xAI: input $1.25 / cached $0.20 / output $2.50 per 1M under 200k prompt tokens; $2.50 / $0.40 / $5.00 at or above 200k (whole request billed at the higher rate). Batch API 20% off. Not free.
Architecture: Proprietary closed weights. Parameter count not disclosed (Artificial Analysis; models.dev).

