### Normalized scores (1-100)

Tool use: 52/100. Function calling is confirmed, and Tau2 is 93.0%, but that is not Tau3. Terminal-Bench Hard is 37.9%, below the Terminal-Bench 2.1 mid band, and Terminal-Bench 2.1, Tau3-Banking, and GDPval-AA are missing.
Reasoning: 74/100. GPQA 91.1% is in the frontier GPQA band, but HLE 34.5% misses the 40% frontier line, CritPt is 6.6%, and the Intelligence Index 26 is an estimate, not a measured Index.
Context window: 95/100. Vendor-verified 1,000,000-token window (1M tier is 95–100). Not 100: no MRCR/RULER result at or above 98% retrieval past 512K.
Multimodal: 68/100. Image in and text out only (60–70 band). MMMU-Pro 74.6% (Artificial Analysis) supports the top of that band; no verified video, PDF, or audio.
Coding: 42/100. No SWE-bench Verified, LiveCodeBench, SciCode, or Terminal-Bench 2.1. Only Terminal-Bench Hard 37.9%, which is below the mid coding band.
Cost efficiency: 90/100. Evaluated tier $1.25/$2.50 per 1M, between the ~$0.60/$2.20 (~92) and ~$1.25/$4.25 (~88) anchors. Paid, not free. Prompts at or above 200k bill $2.50/$5.00.
Overall Score: 66.2/100. Half-up mean of 52, 74, 95, 68, and 42. Best fit for long-context document and image Q&A at a mid price, not as a frontier coding agent; vendor now points general use to Grok 4.7.

